{"shortDescription":"Central European currencies were slightly weaker on Wednesday as investors awaited a National Bank of Poland interest rate decision, with expectations for rates to stay on hold despite inflation accelerating above target.","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Central European currencies were slightly weaker on Wednesday as investors awaited a National Bank of Poland interest rate decision, with expectations for rates to stay on hold despite inflation accelerating above target."]},{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"p","children":["A Reuters poll showed the NBP was expected to leave interest rates unchanged later on Wednesday despite annual inflation accelerating to 4.0% in September, moving above the central bank's 1.5% to 3.5% target range."]}]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"p","children":["The rise was driven mainly by higher fuel prices linked to the conflict in the Middle East, although recently announced government measures aimed at limiting fuel prices are expected to curb inflation in coming months."]}]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"p","children":["\"Although September saw inflation jump to 4.0%, exceeding the tolerance band, new government measures and lower core inflation should allow the central bank to continue waiting,\" ING said."]}]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"p","children":["\"Continued hesitation by the NBP would thus signal a dovish stance, contrasting with current hawkish market pricing that anticipates around 100bps of tightening. Attention will then shift to the (NBP) governor's press conference tomorrow.\""]}]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"p","children":["The Polish zloty ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"OANDA:EURPLN","text":"OANDA:EURPLN"}}," was a touch down at 4.3745 per euro at 0728 GMT."]}]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Data published on Wednesday showed Hungarian inflation accelerated to 1.6% year on year in September fro